From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jesse Casco <jesse.casco@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 10:17:08 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 22/24] LOCAL COMPAT: A16 retain CPU and LLC passive cooling
 maps

Preserve 42 CPU/LLC zones and 95C passive trips from the current known DTB. Binding presence checked on NOHZ boot; threshold suitability and full hardware validation remain separate upstream gates.
---
 .../qcom/glymur-asus-zenbook-a16-ux3607oa.dts | 799 ++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 799 insertions(+)

